###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}5\blueE{c}+\maroonD{d}+\goldE{2}-\goldE{1}
\\\\
&=5\blueE{c}+\maroonD{d}+\goldE{1}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $5\blueE{c}+\maroonD{d}$ since they aren't like terms.
